---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { appVersion, endpoints } from '../../../server/api-contract.mjs';
const groups = [...new Set(endpoints.map(endpoint => endpoint.group))];
---
<Base title={`Chatty API v${appVersion}`}>
  <main class="api-docs"><header><a class="brand" href="/">chatty<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a><span class="version">API v{appVersion}</span></header><span class="eyebrow">THE CONVERSATION, CONNECTED</span><h1>Build with Chatty.</h1><p class="intro">The live API contract for this release. Send messages over HTTP, receive updates through Server-Sent Events.</p><nav><a href="/api/docs/openapi.json">OpenAPI JSON ↗</a><a href="/api/health">Health status ↗</a><a href="/rooms">Back to chat ↗</a></nav>
  <section class="guidance"><h2>Authentication & requests</h2><p>Session endpoints require the <code>chat_user_id</code> HttpOnly cookie set by joining or restoring an identity. The server decides who is acting; a user ID in the body never changes your identity. POST JSON with <code>Content-Type: application/json</code>. Cross-origin writes are rejected.</p><p>Failed requests return <code>{'{ "error": "description" }'}</code>. Missing sessions return 401. Keep recovery codes private. Documentation and health are public.</p></section>
  <label for="api-search">Find an endpoint</label><input id="api-search" type="search" placeholder="Search paths, methods, or descriptions…" /><p id="no-results" hidden>No endpoints match your search.</p>
  {groups.map(group => <section class="endpoint-group"><h2>{group}</h2>{endpoints.filter(endpoint => endpoint.group === group).map(endpoint => <details class="endpoint"><summary><span class:list={['method', endpoint.method]}>{endpoint.method.toUpperCase()}</span><code>{endpoint.path}</code><span class="auth">{endpoint.auth}</span></summary><div class="endpoint-body"><h3>{endpoint.summary}</h3>{endpoint.body && <><h4>Request body</h4>{Object.keys(endpoint.body).length ? <dl>{Object.entries(endpoint.body).map(([key, value]) => <><dt><code>{key}</code></dt><dd>{value}</dd></>)}</dl> : <p>No body fields required. Send <code>{'{}'}</code>.</p>}</>}<h4>Response</h4><p>{endpoint.result}</p></div></details>)}</section>)}
  <section class="guidance"><h2>Live events</h2><p>Room streams emit <code>ready</code>, <code>message</code>, <code>presence</code>, <code>userlist</code>, <code>typing</code>, <code>mention</code>, <code>newroom</code>, <code>renamed</code>, and <code>notificationsread</code>. Each named SSE event contains one JSON data payload. Heartbeats arrive every 30 seconds. Presence has a 60-second disconnect grace period. Use history’s <code>after</code> cursor to catch up after reconnecting.</p><h2>Health states</h2><p><strong>up · 200:</strong> database reachable and all migration checksums match this build.<br /><strong>down · 503:</strong> database unavailable.<br /><strong>error · 500:</strong> database reachable but schema is out of sync, or the schema check failed.</p><p>If the server itself is stopped, no endpoint can answer; a monitoring service must treat connection failure as down.</p></section>
  <footer>Chatty v{appVersion} · Contract and generated test documentation follow package.json.</footer></main>
  <script>document.querySelector('#api-search').addEventListener('input', event => { const query = event.target.value.toLowerCase(); let found = 0; document.querySelectorAll('.endpoint').forEach(element => { element.hidden = !element.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(query); if (!element.hidden) found++; }); document.querySelectorAll('.endpoint-group').forEach(group => group.hidden = !group.querySelector('.endpoint:not([hidden])')); document.querySelector('#no-results').hidden = found > 0; });</script>
</Base>
<style>.api-docs{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:35px 24px 70px}.api-docs header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:65px}.version{background:var(--raised);color:var(--violet);padding:9px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:700}.api-docs h1{font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,60px);letter-spacing:-2px;margin:12px 0}.intro{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;max-width:650px}.api-docs nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;color:var(--violet);margin:28px 0}.guidance{padding:23px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--panel);margin:30px 0}.guidance h2{font-size:20px}.guidance p,.endpoint-body p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}.endpoint-group{margin:35px 0}.endpoint-group>h2{font-size:21px}.endpoint{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;margin:10px 0;overflow:hidden}.endpoint summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}.endpoint summary code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.method{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.8px;font-weight:800;background:#b2a0ff20;color:var(--violet);padding:6px 9px;border-radius:5px;min-width:52px;text-align:center}.method.post{background:#d5f79a20;color:#99c956}.auth{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-left:auto}.endpoint-body{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px}.endpoint-body h3{font-size:17px}.endpoint-body h4{font-size:12px;color:var(--violet);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}.endpoint-body dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr;gap:12px;font-size:13px}.endpoint-body dd{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}code{font-size:.93em}.api-docs footer{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:22px}</style>
